"_gp_shrhldr_yield":null,"_score_shrhldr_yield":0.0,"_gate_share_shrink":0.7208907164391016,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.4727830657308592,"_gp_sbc_dilution":false,"_score_sbc_dilution":0.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.0064,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":4.3,"_gate_insider_buying":null,"_gp_insider_buying":null,"_score_insider_buying":null,"pf":[],"description_full":"Bitmine Immersion Technologies, Inc. operates as a digital asset technology company in the United States. The company focuses on acquiring, holding and managing digital assets, as well as providing critical blockchain infrastructure services; and ethereum and bitcoin mining and hosting activities. It also provides blockchain infrastructure services; investments in early-stage blockchain opportunities; and ethereum-adjacent advisory services. In addition, the company offers blockchain validation and staking services; operational, maintenance and consulting services; and sells mining equipment. The company was formerly known as Sandy Springs Holdings Inc. Bitmine Immersion Technologies, Inc. was incorporated in 2019 and is headquartered in Norwalk, Connecticut.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Chi  Tsang C.F.A. | CEO & Director | Age 56","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 26 people. Revenue per employee of $4.8M ranks in the top quartile among Financial Services peers, with revenue growing 313%/yr across its filed history. Stock-based compensation of $2.3M per employee reflects an ownership culture. Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (7/10).","financial_summary":["BitMine Immersion Technologies, is a mid-cap financial services business with a $8.7B market cap on $125M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +478% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at -38% against a 10% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, and 23% gross margins are typical of commodity economics where competitors can replicate the product cheaply.","Stock-based comp at 47% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 2/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Operating margins 5236% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 6.1% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 398% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Large open-market insider purchases (net $77.1M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business","Growing faster than most Financial Services peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Did Ethereum Buying Pause Just Shift Bitmine Immersion Technologies' (BMNR) Investment Narrative?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/software/nyse-bmnr/bitmine-immersion-technologies/news/did-ethereum-buying-pause-just-shift-bitmine-immersion-techn","date":"2026-11-26","timestamp":1795723813.072,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.052,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Bitmine Immersion Technologies kndigt eine Bardividende in Hhe von 0,01 US-Dollar pro Stammaktie an","source":"prnewswire.com","link":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bitmine-immersion-technologies-kundigt-eine-bardividende-in-hohe-von-0-01-us-dollar-pro-stammaktie-an-302950889.html","date":"2026-11-25","timestamp":1795646340.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["dividend"]},{"title":"Bitmine Immersion Technologies kondigt een contant dividend van 0,01 dollar per gewoon aandeel aan","source":"prnewswire.com","link":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bitmine-immersion-technologies-kondigt-een-contant-dividend-van-0-01-dollar-per-gewoon-aandeel-aan-302950887.html","date":"2026-11-25","timestamp":1795646160.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["dividend"]},{"title":"Bitmine Immersion Technologies annuncia un dividendo in contanti di 0,01 dollari per azione ordinaria","source":"prnewswire.com","link":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bitmine-immersion-technologies-annuncia-un-dividendo-in-contanti-di-0-01-dollari-per-azione-ordinaria-302950884.html","date":"2026-11-25","timestamp":1795645860.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.586,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["dividen